        }
      },
      "location": {
        "known": true,
        "value": "Can be purchased from Twin Maiden Husks at the Roundtable Hold after giving them the Ghost-Glovewort Picker's Bell Bearing (2) .; Wyndham Catacombs : Found in the sewer area amongst the Putrid Corpses. [ Map Link ]; Auriza Hero's Grave : In the first Chariot Hall, drop down the openings on either side just before the second ramp. In the room below, head west and up the steps and then turn right into the next corridor. Follow the path to a second Chariot Hall where two Chariots are running side by side with a short delay between them. As you exit into this hall, turn left to find two ramps. In between them in the back is a small opening where the glovewort can be found. [ Map Link ]",
        "provenance": {
